sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as ML Client<br/>(Python SDK)
    participant Server as MLflow Server<br/>5000/TCP HTTP
    participant Auth as kubernetes-auth<br/>(Plugin)
    participant PG as PostgreSQL<br/>5432/TCP
    participant S3 as Object Storage<br/>(S3/GCS/Azure)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Client,S3: Flow 1: Experiment Run Logging

    Client->>Server: POST /api/2.0/mlflow/runs/create<br/>Authorization: Bearer <K8s Token><br/>X-MLFLOW-WORKSPACE: <namespace>
    Server->>Auth: Validate token
    Auth->>Auth: Verify K8s ServiceAccount token
    Auth-->>Server: Token valid, workspace resolved
    Server->>PG: INSERT run metadata<br/>(workspace-scoped query)
    PG-->>Server: Run ID created
    Server-->>Client: 200 OK (run_id)

    Client->>Server: POST /api/2.0/mlflow/runs/log-metric<br/>Authorization: Bearer <K8s Token>
    Server->>Auth: Validate token
    Auth-->>Server: OK
    Server->>PG: INSERT metric data
    PG-->>Server: Stored
    Server-->>Client: 200 OK

    Client->>Server: PUT /api/2.0/mlflow-artifacts/artifacts/model.pkl<br/>Authorization: Bearer <K8s Token>
    Server->>Auth: Validate token
    Auth-->>Server: OK
    Server->>S3: PUT object (workspace-prefixed path)<br/>AWS SigV4 / Provider Auth
    S3-->>Server: Stored
    Server-->>Client: 200 OK

    Note over Client,S3: Flow 2: Model Registry Operations

    Client->>Server: POST /api/2.0/mlflow/registered-models/create<br/>Authorization: Bearer <K8s Token>
    Server->>Auth: Validate token
    Auth-->>Server: OK
    Server->>PG: INSERT model metadata
    PG-->>Server: Model created
    Server-->>Client: 200 OK (model name)

    Note over Client,S3: Flow 3: AI Gateway LLM Proxy (when enabled)

    Client->>Server: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Authorization: Bearer <K8s Token>
    Server->>Auth: Validate token
    Auth-->>Server: OK

    rect rgb(240, 240, 240)
        Note right of Server: AI Gateway<br/>(disabled by default)
        Server->>S3: POST to LLM Provider<br/>(OpenAI/Bedrock)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS<br/>Provider API Key
        S3-->>Server: LLM Response
    end

    Server-->>Client: Chat completion response
